<title>BULGARIA: BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR JUNE 25.</title>
<headline>BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR JUNE 25.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bulgarian National Bank set</p>
<p>the following fixed exchange rates against the Bulgarian lev</p>
<p>for Wednesday, June 25:</p>
<p>(Previous in brackets)</p>
<p>    USD  1,674.70 (1,687.80)	CHF  1,167.30 (1,176.20)</p>
<p>    DEM    971.07 (979.29)	  GBP  2,795.70 (2,801.10)</p>
<p>    ATS    138.02 (139.18)</p>
<p>Trading volume for Tuesday (total as dollar equivalent):</p>
<p>    Banks bought    $17.40 million</p>
<p>    Banks sold	$14.31 million</p>
<p>Total turnover  $31.71 million ($21.97 million)</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 91188</p>
</text>
